sequenceDiagram
    participant ParticipantApp
    participant LocalAgent
    participant Collectors
    participant LocalAudit
    participant Backend
    ParticipantApp->>LocalAgent: Accept event scope and request preflight
    LocalAgent->>Backend: Enroll and retrieve versioned policy
    Backend-->>LocalAgent: Session identity and validated configuration
    LocalAgent->>Collectors: Probe mandatory coverage and start events
    Collectors-->>LocalAgent: Ready checkpoint or explicit capability gap
    LocalAgent->>Collectors: Snapshot processes and scoped inventory
    Collectors-->>LocalAgent: Findings and events observed during scan
    LocalAgent->>LocalAgent: Reconcile identity, coverage and event order
    LocalAgent->>LocalAudit: Commit admission report and outbox
    LocalAgent->>Backend: Submit report and checkpoint for admission
    Backend-->>LocalAgent: Revision-bound lease or refusal reasons
    LocalAgent->>LocalAgent: Check intervening events and current health
    LocalAgent-->>ParticipantApp: Show effective status and required actions
